Assumptions 23.1 and 30.1, the qualifying subset of the occupied
saturated labels is exactly $\{6\}$, and

$$
\pi_e\{\Psi>0,\xi=1\}=p_6>\frac1{1250}.
\tag{FC.125}
$$

No new threshold for the minimum actual count follows.

