4.1, the directed coordinates are

$$
(u_5,v_5)=\frac{(-1+x_5^2,-2x_5)}{1+x_5^2},\qquad
(u_6,v_6)=\frac{(2x_6,-1+x_6^2)}{1+x_6^2}.
